      "number": 2,
      "title": "Why Vectors?",
      "text": [
        "Many real-world quantities need both size AND direction.",
        "• Velocity — wind at 15 mph to the north-east",
        "• Force — 50 N pulling down at 30°",
        "• Displacement — walking 3 blocks east, then 2 north",
        "Scalars (speed, mass, temperature) need only size."
      ],
      "images": [],
      "speaker_notes": []
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "title": "Module 13 — Skills Overview",
      "text": [
        "Writing a vector in component form from initial/terminal points",
