      "text": [
        "Test 3, Problem 9: Vector addition, scalar multiplication, magnitude, and direction angle calculations.",
        "Part A: Component form",
        "Part B: Operations",
        "Given: P(3, −1) to Q(−2, 4)",
        "v = ⟨−2−3, 4−(−1)⟩",
        "v = ⟨−5, 5⟩",
        "|v| = √(25+25) = √50 = 5√2",
        "θ = tan⁻¹(5/−5)+180° = −45°+180°",
        "θ = 135°",
        "Given: u = ⟨2, −3⟩, v = ⟨−1, 4⟩",
        "u + v = ⟨1, 1⟩",
        "2u − 3v =",
        "⟨4,−6⟩ − ⟨−3,12⟩ = ⟨7, −18⟩",
        "|2u − 3v| = √(49+324) = √373",
        "≈ 19.3"
      ],
